      "note": "泓水 and 日照山: from 江北渡口 (绮云镇's map) the ford runs south across the wide cold river — chest-deep water by the north bank, the bend in the middle where the current runs under (江心), the south side from which a corner of 山烟寺 shows — to 江南渡口 and its jetty, where the boatman's boat puts in. South the yellow-earth path climbs: the foot of the hill (east, the road to 乔阴县城's 北门), then the winding path up, west, south, and south-west onto the mossy stone 山路 under the cliff carved 「山烟寺」; west round the bend to the 山门 before the temple's wall (the temple is its own map); west of the gate the tunnel cut through the cliff, smelling of sulphur, to 晚月庄's bamboo hills.",
